  exact bpFromTM_full_lengthBound M n hn

/-- **§165.7 — `C_det_step1_accepting_correct`** (paper §11.1 p. 61
Lemma 44 per-triple acceptance criterion).

**Paper Lemma 44 acceptance criterion.** A configuration triple
