/-- **§179.1 — `P_ne_NP_ultimate_conditional`** (paper §49.1 p. 230
Lean formalisation goal "axiom-free, no sorry"; paper §40 Theorem 207
p. 199; paper §40 Theorem 232 p. 213; paper §10.2 pp. 54-55).

