### Statement

At `κ = ℓ = Nat.log 2 n` and under the paper §18 Lemma 124 bridge
hypothesis `hPermToQ`, together with an explicit central-binomial
dominance hypothesis
`hCentralBinomDom : n^{Nat.log 2 n / 4} ≤ Nat.choose n (n/2)`, there
