identity-minor argument is §189 unchanged.

### Witnesses

`α := Fin 1`, `Φ := lemma_124_Phi_chosen = {0}`,
`z := lemma_124_z_chosen M n hn2 htb hns`,
`V := lemma_124_V_chosen n` — the §189.1-§189.3 concrete witness,
