     transitivity composing §221.2 + §223.

   * **§224.4** `theorem_216_unconditional_from_221_and_223` —
     the fully landed version using ONLY §221.2 + §223.1.

   * **§224.5** `theorem_216_full_statement_audit : True` — audit.

