/-! ## §233 — **NP-side SoS port: brutal-honesty analysis**
    (paper §18 Lemma 124 pp. 99-109 NP-side identity-minor;
     paper §17.1 p. 95 constant-degree SoS substitution;
     paper §40.3 Theorem 217 p. 204 NP-side rank bound;
