`Q_verifier` (paper §18.1 Definition 38). -/
theorem Q_verifier_eq (W : PartitionedCompilerOutput) :
    W.Q_verifier = Q_times_Phi_135 W.Φ W.z W.V := rfl

/-- **§241.1e — `embedded_Q_eq`**: definitional unfolding of
